{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000006155","bookName":"La ira de los cuatro herederos","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000006155/42000006155.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":696415,"followCount":17313,"introduction":"Héctor Montes, leyenda empresarial de la República de Auria, adopta a los cuatro hijos de héroes caídos tras una inundación. Retirado al campo, cuida la tumba de sus camarada. Cuando la empresa de su hija Valeria sale a bolsa, la ambiciosa familia de su prometido, Bruno Blanco, arrasa la tumba, agrede a Héctor y lo acusa falsamente. Valeria y sus tres hermanos, ahora poderosos, vengan la humillación. Exponen los crímenes de los Blanco y defienden el honor de su padre.","chapterCount":60,"labels":["Divine Tycoon","Family Bonds"],"tags":["Divine Tycoon","Family Bonds"],"typeTwoIds":[303],"typeTwoNames":["Urbano"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":303,"name":"Urbano","replaceName":"urbano"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Urbano","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"La-ira-de-los-cuatro-herederos","bookNameLower":"la-ira-de-los-cuatro-herederos","shelfTime":"2026-02-20 19:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-02-20 19:00:00","performerIdList":[]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700401750","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/05/5x5/55x1/551x6/55160000024/700401750_1/700401750.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795132800&Signature=t-a5eUxFfMhnmg~vnG645e2ky-VEharV2kw2D3wsz9WTlThk53VODAx~j8-fHKTKcZyjjUOGkCKH5E~3x1aXGZmhXi-O1uglKN2iM1LDV9hu~dDViFniNfgNo~CCO29bqO9ijEXCpwaPevS67jareJCPAjYVbEj32J8ARlMck8HhRrZOOd5wsVuY9CwuFNQvTE-s1a8WNSrrxr3cES6OxdeHXb2QULRB9ovW78MctS5EQIuNMXjf~YYVnd7yYv8FXvvSxHu1v2xktlYrixjqVIXZfGvg0sQEaG9nyh0GKfj3XuPSdRzAw6w5rA2WPTK2-oxmeigOfRj3jy7yLbbu7g__&Key-Pair-Id=K3HA2TLE2QH99V","cover":"https://thwztvideo.dramaboxdb.com/05/5x5/55x1/551x6/55160000024/700401750_1/700401750.mp4.jpg@w=100&h=135","duration":227337,"price":0},{"id":"700401751","index":1,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/15/5x5/55x